msgctxt "64"
msgid "(Okay, time to find my next customer.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Oh, wait. She's here already."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "I'm back. Did you get any customers?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "No..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid "You know, I was just talking to a restaurant owner nearby..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"He was telling me there are a lot of renovation scams going around lately. "
"People asking about termites, smoke alarms, and such."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Those men on their way out had coveralls on, so I thought they might be a "
"couple of phony renovators."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Did something happen while I was gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "No... Nothing important."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Really?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"Well, here's something for your trouble. You did me a big favor, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Eh?"

msgctxt "220"
msgid "I couldn't make you watch the place for free."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"But I pretty much just stood around the whole time. And I can't take money "
"from you after all you've done for me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "I'm a proud Kamurocho woman. I refuse to make you work without paying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Just take it and make me happy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid "All right. If you insist."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "You got <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I might ask for your help again sometime, now that I know I can count on "
"you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You got 1,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

